# Admin module UI

For work under these paths, treat `docs/admin.md` as the product scope source.

- Match routes, page behavior, permissions, and bilingual fields from the cited section.
- Do not invent pages or API fields not in the blueprint section being implemented.
- Backend for this product is NestJS, not Spring — when touching API contracts, align with the NestJS service.
